<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Test Instructions - Snoop System</title>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="glass-card p-5">
                    <div class="text-center mb-5">
                        <div class="display-4 text-primary mb-3"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list"></i></div>
                        <h2 class="font-weight-bold">Examination Instructions</h2>
                        <p class="text-dim">Please read the following guidelines carefully before starting.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="test-details mb-5 p-4 rounded"
                        style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <p class="small text-dim mb-1">Test ID</p>
                                <h5 class="font-weight-bold">
                                    <%= test.id %>
                                </h5>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <p class="small text-dim mb-1">Duration</p>
                                <h5 class="font-weight-bold">
                                    <%= test.testDuration %> Minutes
                                </h5>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="rules-section mb-5">
                        <h5 class="font-weight-bold mb-4"
                            style="color: var(--secondary); border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary); padding-left: 15px;">
                            Proctoring Rules</h5>
                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                            <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                                <i class="fas fa-video mr-3 mt-1 text-primary"></i>
                                <span><strong>Webcam Mandatory:</strong> Your webcam is now active. Ensure your face is
                                    clearly visible throughout the exam.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                                <i class="fas fa-eye mr-3 mt-1 text-primary"></i>
                                <span><strong>Engagement:</strong> Looking away from the screen or using multiple
                                    monitors will flag your session for suspicious activity.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                                <i class="fas fa-user-friends mr-3 mt-1 text-primary"></i>
                                <span><strong>Single User:</strong> Only the registered student should be visible.
                                    Detection of extra people will result in a warning.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start">
                                <i class="fas fa-keyboard mr-3 mt-1 text-primary"></i>
                                <span><strong>Integrity Score:</strong> A real-time integrity score is being calculated.
                                    This score is final and submitted with your results.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="mb-3 d-flex align-items-start p-3 rounded" style="background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);">
                                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle mr-3 mt-1 text-danger"></i>
                                <span class="text-danger"><strong>Navigation Locked:</strong> Once you start the test, you <strong>cannot go back</strong> or refresh the page. Any attempt to leave the page will be flagged and may result in auto-submission.</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center mt-5">
                        <a href="/student/home" class="btn-snoop btn-glass mr-3 px-4">
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i> Back
                        </a>
                        <form action="/student/startExam" method="POST">
                            <input type="hidden" name="email" value="<%= email %>">
                            <input type="hidden" name="testID" value="<%= test.id %>">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn-snoop px-5">
                                Start Examination <i class="fas fa-play ml-2"></i>
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>